{"seq":3,"slug":"responsive-motion","title":"响应式与动效偏好","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility/perception/responsive-motion","wordCount":1182,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"响应式与动效偏好\">响应式与动效偏好</h1><p>把浏览器字号调到 200%,或者用手机横屏访问后台系统,很多界面会立刻崩坏:文字被裁切、按钮叠成一团、出现讨厌的横向滚动条。再打开一个满是视差滚动和自动轮播的落地页,对前庭功能敏感的用户而言,这不是炫酷,而是头晕恶心。布局的弹性与动效的克制,是可访问性里最容易被「设计感」牺牲、却直接影响低视力与认知障碍用户的两个维度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>这一篇关注空间与运动的适配,服务<a href=\"../foundations/a11y-user-model\">基础章 POUR 中的「可感知」与「可操作」</a>:低视力用户需要放大内容而不丢失信息,运动敏感用户需要能关掉动画,触控用户需要足够大的目标。核心思路是「内容适应用户,而非用户迁就内容」,具体落在三组能力上:</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[空间与运动适配] --&gt; B[缩放与重排&lt;br/&gt;放大不破版]&#10;  A --&gt; C[动效偏好&lt;br/&gt;可被关闭]&#10;  A --&gt; D[目标尺寸&lt;br/&gt;点得中]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[400% 缩放下 reflow]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[不强制双向滚动]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[prefers-reduced-motion]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[WCAG 2.5.8 至少 24px]\">flowchart TD\n  A[空间与运动适配] --&gt; B[缩放与重排&lt;br/&gt;放大不破版]\n  A --&gt; C[动效偏好&lt;br/&gt;可被关闭]\n  A --&gt; D[目标尺寸&lt;br/&gt;点得中]\n  B --&gt; B1[400% 缩放下 reflow]\n  B --&gt; B2[不强制双向滚动]\n  C --&gt; C1[prefers-reduced-motion]\n  D --&gt; D1[WCAG 2.5.8 至少 24px]</pre><h2 id=\"缩放与重排-reflow\">缩放与重排(reflow)</h2><p>低视力用户最常用的适配就是放大。WCAG 1.4.4 要求文本能放大到 200% 仍可用,而更进一步的 1.4.10「Reflow」要求:内容在等效 400% 缩放(对应 320 CSS 像素宽的视口)下,不出现需要双向滚动的情况——也就是说,纵向滚动可以,横向滚动不行(数据表格等少数例外)。</p>\n<p>满足 reflow 的关键不是写死像素,而是让布局天生有弹性:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* 用相对单位让文字随用户设置缩放 */&#10;body {&#10;  font-size: 1rem;&#10;  line-height: 1.5;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 容器随视口收缩,不写死宽度 */&#10;.card {&#10;  max-width: 100%;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 用 flex/grid 自动换行,而非固定多列 */&#10;.grid {&#10;  display: grid;&#10;  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(16rem, 1fr));&#10;  gap: 1rem;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 用相对单位让文字随用户设置缩放 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">body</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  font-size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  line-height</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 容器随视口收缩,不写死宽度 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.card</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  max-width</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 用 flex/grid 自动换行,而非固定多列 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.grid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">grid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  grid-template-columns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">repeat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">auto-fit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">minmax</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  gap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>一个常被忽视的硬伤是 viewport meta 标签里写 <code>user-scalable=no</code> 或 <code>maximum-scale=1</code>——它在移动端<strong>禁止用户双指放大</strong>,直接违反 WCAG。永远不要禁用缩放。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动效偏好-prefers-reduced-motion\">动效偏好:prefers-reduced-motion</h2><p>视差滚动、大幅位移动画、自动播放的轮播,会让前庭功能障碍用户产生眩晕、恶心甚至偏头痛。操作系统提供了「减少动态效果」的系统级开关,CSS 能通过媒体查询读到它:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* 默认可以有适度动效 */&#10;.panel {&#10;  transition: transform 0.3s ease;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 用户开启&quot;减少动态效果&quot;时,关掉或弱化动画 */&#10;@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {&#10;  .panel {&#10;    transition: none;&#10;  }&#10;  *,&#10;  *::before,&#10;  *::after {&#10;    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;&#10;    animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 默认可以有适度动效 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.panel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  transition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: transform </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">s</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ease</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 用户开启\"减少动态效果\"时,关掉或弱化动画 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@media</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  .panel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">none</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">::before</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">::after</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    animation-duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ms</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !important</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    animation-iteration-count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !important</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>正确的心智模型是「默认克制、尊重偏好」:动效服务于沟通(状态过渡、引导注意),而非装饰;一旦用户表达了减少动效的偏好,就必须照办。WCAG 2.2.2 还单独要求:任何自动播放、持续超过 5 秒的动态内容,必须提供暂停、停止或隐藏的手段——自动轮播尤其常踩这条。</p>\n<h2 id=\"目标尺寸-点得中才点得了\">目标尺寸:点得中才点得了</h2><p>运动障碍用户、手抖的老年用户、在颠簸车厢里用手机的人,都需要足够大的可点击区域。WCAG 2.2 新增的 2.5.8「目标尺寸(最小值)」要求交互目标至少为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24 \\times 24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span> CSS 像素(AAA 级的 2.5.5 更严,要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>44</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>44</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">44 \\times 44</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">44</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">44</span></span></span></span></span>),否则需有足够间距补偿。</p>\n<p>下表汇总三组适配能力的关键参数:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>适配维度</th>\n<th>WCAG 准则</th>\n<th>关键阈值</th>\n<th>常见错误</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>文本缩放</td>\n<td>1.4.4</td>\n<td>200% 仍可用</td>\n<td>用 px 写死字号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重排 reflow</td>\n<td>1.4.10</td>\n<td>400%/320px 不横向滚动</td>\n<td>固定宽度容器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动效偏好</td>\n<td>2.3.3 / 2.2.2</td>\n<td>尊重 reduced-motion;&gt;5s 可暂停</td>\n<td>无视系统偏好、自动轮播不可停</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目标尺寸</td>\n<td>2.5.8 (AA)</td>\n<td>≥ 24×24 px</td>\n<td>图标按钮过小、链接挨太近</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>间距与尺寸还和<a href=\"../aria/keyboard-focus\">键盘焦点</a>体验相关:目标太小不仅难点,焦点环也容易互相重叠看不清。</p>\n<h2 id=\"响应式与可访问性的交汇\">响应式与可访问性的交汇</h2><p>响应式设计和可访问性常被当成两件事,实则高度重叠:一个真正响应式的布局,天然满足 reflow;用相对单位、避免固定高度的容器,天然支持文本缩放;移动优先的大点击区,天然满足目标尺寸。换言之,做好响应式工程的团队,已经免费拿到大半的空间适配可访问性。剩下需要专门补的,主要是动效偏好与缩放禁用这两类——它们不会被普通响应式开发自动覆盖,得显式处理。这些适配项同样应纳入<a href=\"../engineering/testing-audit\">测试与审计</a>:用浏览器缩放到 400%、开启系统的减少动效开关,逐页走查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>空间与运动适配服务「可感知/可操作」原则,核心是让内容适应用户:缩放、重排、动效偏好、目标尺寸。</li>\n<li>文本须能放大 200%,内容在 400%/320px 下不横向滚动;绝不用 <code>user-scalable=no</code> 禁用缩放。</li>\n<li>用 <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code> 尊重系统偏好,默认克制动效;超过 5 秒的自动内容须可暂停。</li>\n<li>WCAG 2.2 新增目标尺寸 ≥ 24×24px;太小的目标既难点也让<a href=\"../aria/keyboard-focus\">焦点环</a>重叠。</li>\n<li>优秀的响应式工程天然满足大半空间适配,但缩放禁用与动效偏好须显式处理,并纳入<a href=\"../engineering/testing-audit\">测试与审计</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"响应式与动效偏好","id":"响应式与动效偏好"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"缩放与重排(reflow)","id":"缩放与重排-reflow"},{"level":2,"text":"动效偏好:prefers-reduced-motion","id":"动效偏好-prefers-reduced-motion"},{"level":2,"text":"目标尺寸:点得中才点得了","id":"目标尺寸-点得中才点得了"},{"level":2,"text":"响应式与可访问性的交汇","id":"响应式与可访问性的交汇"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"色彩与对比度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility/perception/color-contrast"},"next":{"title":"测试与审计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility/engineering/testing-audit"}}